    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "As IoT adoption accelerates, businesses need scalable and secure connectivity solutions. 1NCE, a global leader in IoT connectivity, partnered with Storm Reply to develop a unified API infrastructure that ensures secure authentication, seamless integration, and real-time monitoring."
    },
    {
